1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,740
Meet official, a workspace for manual
underwriting of launch claims.

2
00:00:05,145 --> 00:00:10,560
A reviewer checks each claim against product,
rollout, and audience facts.

3
00:00:11,185 --> 00:00:16,960
official links each promise to reviewed product,
rollout, test, and audience records.

4
00:00:17,525 --> 00:00:19,460
Reviewers follow each source.

5
00:00:19,605 --> 00:00:25,880
Each claim gets one result: Supported,
Contradicted, Unknown, or Not checked.

6
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:29,280
Missing or old evidence cannot prove a claim.

7
00:00:29,305 --> 00:00:33,000
Milo guides the fictional workspace tour.

8
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:36,540
Open a finding to inspect its sources.

9
00:00:37,065 --> 00:00:41,100
If copy needs a change, official prepares an
internal proposal.

10
00:00:41,305 --> 00:00:42,540
It does not publish.

11
00:00:42,925 --> 00:00:44,940
People approve each change.

12
00:00:45,285 --> 00:00:48,580
The writing handoff carries approved guidance.

13
00:00:48,985 --> 00:00:53,060
The FalkorDB graph links claims to their
evidence.

14
00:00:53,625 --> 00:00:58,060
Plugins preview connections;
they do not import data.
